{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/6f149859385b756c33fc33ed7e3f71ce.avif?t=1764870312\" width=616 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squidly wasn\u2019t a hero. He was just a squishy little reef-dweller with more heart than muscle. But when Lord Azure and his Abyssal Cult started dragging folks into the deep and wrecking his home, even a squid has his limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then Poseidon \u2014 ancient sea god, part-time drama queen \u2014 blessed him with divine power and one mission: get revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/f97724af9a979a2c028a292135f7d074.poster.avif?t=1764870312\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/f97724af9a979a2c028a292135f7d074.webm?t=1764870312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in this <strong>fast-paced underwater roguelike</strong>, Squidly fights back using whatever weapons his enemies drop \u2014 from mantis shrimp knuckle dusters to barnacle blasters. <strong>Every run is randomized</strong>, chaotic, and packed with cartoon mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/895e74834c925e794f1aae180633c7e1.poster.avif?t=1764870312\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/895e74834c925e794f1aae180633c7e1.webm?t=1764870312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/extras/895e74834c925e794f1aae180633c7e1.mp4?t=1764870312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive waves of enemies</strong>, <strong>steal their gear</strong>, and take on the ocean's deadliest bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s underqualified. He\u2019s overpowered. He\u2019s out for revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Squidly\u2019s Revenge</i> \u2014 a deep-sea brawl for the ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge powerful bosses, defeat them to steal their boss abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of enemies and bosses till the very end\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate run modifiers that ramp up difficulty - and the rewards. Mix and match to tailor the perfect run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn permanent upgrades between runs\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same - randomized bosses and enemies to keep you on your toes (tentacles?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Endless Game Mode for infinite replayability.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Splash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854780/300193460e9281aece67a00887d26b21a14cd2f0.jpg"},{"name":"What\u2019s This Squishy Thing?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854780/eb4a8a7fde7616afc8532b9d264c53848647f089.jpg"},{"name":"Clam Up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854780/3c5a681f12529cd8db02016dcaf5faaafdf5dbd2.jpg"},{"name":"Tentacle Tactician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854780/9aaaafe70c6fc0cf3fc87e029efc9de4e688bcb2.jpg"},{"name":"Reel Professional","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/i