mies</strong>, <strong>steal their gear</strong>, and take on the ocean's deadliest bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s underqualified. He\u2019s overpowered. He\u2019s out for revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Squidly\u2019s Revenge</i> \u2014 a deep-sea brawl for the ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge powerful bosses, defeat them to steal their boss abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of enemies and bosses till the very end\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate run modifiers that ramp up difficulty - and the rewards. Mix and match to tailor the perfect run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn permanent upgrades between runs\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same - randomized bosses and enemies to keep you on your toes (tentacles?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Endless Game Mode for infinite replayability.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","developers":["Howling Wolf Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854780/42033973baacad20b8453b9481083ed4d4d48e84/header.jpg?t=1764870312","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854780/2043891864/dee595ceb90e16304f188859d400fa7a693bbd69/1763126642/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763126950","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854780/2043891864/dee595ceb90e16304f188859d400fa7a693bbd69/1763126642/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763126950","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854780/2043891864/dee595ceb90e16304f188859d400fa7a693bbd69/1763126642/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763126950","id":257171033,"name":"Squidlys Revenge Out Now Trailer","thumbnail":"https